WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
the same session, sent twice

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.000
point your agent at one address

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.500
tool output shrinks before it's billed

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:16.500
the wheel turns. most of it never gets billed

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.500
ask twice, pay once

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.500
busy provider, next provider

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:30.000
measured, not promised

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
see every token

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
one static binary · 10.9 MiB · 12.6 MiB idle RAM
